The directional asymmetry---linear forward HML$\to$SMB but nonlinear
reverse SMB$\to$HML---is discussed in Section~\ref{sec:ml_validation};
the ``predominantly linear'' characterization applies strictly to the
\emph{forward} direction under the primary fit.

